<title>JAPAN: Toyo Trust to write off bad loans worth Y130 bln.</title>
<headline>Toyo Trust to write off bad loans worth Y130 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyo Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd plans to write-off 130 billion yen of non-performing loans in the full fiscal year to March 31, 1997, a bank official told a news conference on Monday.  </p>
<p>The bank official said Toyo Trust largely completed writing off its bad loans in the first half of this fiscal year, when it used special reserve worth 117.6 billion yen.</p>
</text>
